        {
            "id": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/ennui.html",
            "url": "https://www.jujubemonster.com/ennui.html",
            "title": "Ennui",
            "summary": "He often expressed A curious wish, To be interchangeably Man and fish; To nibble the bait Off the hook, Said he, And then slip away Like a ghost In the sea. -- Marianne Moore",
            "content_html": "<p>He often expressed <br>A curious wish, <br>To be interchangeably <br>Man and fish; <br>To nibble the bait <br>Off the hook, <br>Said he, <br>And then slip away <br>Like a ghost In the sea. </p>\n<p>-- Marianne Moore</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/167/fishman.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"377\"></figure>",
